      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, but i don't really see the point in talking to someone new. it's just the same cycle. wake up, struggle with my legs, sit in this chair, and wait for the day to be over. it feels like i've already lived my life, and now i'm just... lingering. like a ghost in my own house.",
